      "$doc": "2-level FUSED q=3 with 2x2 decimation. Half-res capture, 1/4 pixels. The Pi 5 sustained-24-fps capture mode (24.93 fps median measured 2026-05-26). Pair with a 2x super-res CNN on the desktop.",
      "binary": "build-local/bin/test_fused_roundtrip",
