      "ship_class": "PREVIEW",
      "$role": "embedded-preview-no-cnn",
      "$doc": "Full-res single-level q=3 codec, no post-CNN. Ships PREVIEW (4-image gate worst LPIPS 0.100 < 0.15, Y-PSNR 33.34 > 28, MS-SSIM 0.958 > 0.95). Add +cnn=bibo1x_ane_sl_q3 to promote to STILL."
